&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ollama&#39;s app now follows the system appearance again, restoring dark mode support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed the macOS app to properly hand off to an already-running instance instead of starting a second one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Claude Desktop proxy no longer interrupts in-flight requests when the model catalog updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.33.1...v0.33.2&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.33.1...v0.33.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLX: Qwen3.8 Flash Next support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cmake: make external compat patches idempotent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLX and llama.cpp update&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mlxrunner: add structured output support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mlxrunner: avoid Metal GPU timeouts when loading models from slow storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/pd95/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/pd95&quot;&gt;@pd95&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5226693889&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/17948&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/17948/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/17948&quot;&gt;#17948&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.33.0...v0.33.1&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.33.0...v0.33.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;v0.28.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 584 commits from 270 contributors (76 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kimi-K3 performance push&lt;/strong&gt;: a major optimization effort for Kimi-K3 across the stack — Decode Context Parallel (DCP) support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5024323514&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50484&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50484/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50484&quot;&gt;#50484&lt;/a&gt;), fused FlashKDA decode and prefill kernels (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5035155331&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50654&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50654/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50654&quot;&gt;#50654&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5084819738&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51311&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51311/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51311&quot;&gt;#51311&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5160378588&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52458&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52458/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52458&quot;&gt;#52458&lt;/a&gt;), SiTU activation support for MegaMoE (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5026036754&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50510&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50510/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50510&quot;&gt;#50510&lt;/a&gt;), GEMM-RS for sequence parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5136777880&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52079&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52079/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52079&quot;&gt;#52079&lt;/a&gt;), combined all-gathers with 1.5~3x kernel-level speedup (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5064176312&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51070&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51070/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51070&quot;&gt;#51070&lt;/a&gt;), an adaptive speculative token budget delivering ~60% better DSpark TTFT (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5113682718&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51725&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51725/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51725&quot;&gt;#51725&lt;/a&gt;), and optional shared-expert sharding saving ~17 GiB of memory per GPU (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5053646772&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50912&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50912/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50912&quot;&gt;#50912&lt;/a&gt;). Kimi-K3 also now runs on ROCm with the V2 model runner (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5108926237&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51653&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51653/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51653&quot;&gt;#51653&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek V4&lt;/strong&gt;: sparse MLA now works end-to-end for plain decode, MTP, and DSpark speculative decoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5101531400&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51538&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51538/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51538&quot;&gt;#51538&lt;/a&gt;), joined by AMD Quark NVFP4 support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4835520784&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47972&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47972/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47972&quot;&gt;#47972&lt;/a&gt;), reasoning-effort prompts and mappings (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5030980529&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50580&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50580/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50580&quot;&gt;#50580&lt;/a&gt;), sparse top-k metadata kernel optimizations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5137310673&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52084&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52084/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52084&quot;&gt;#52084&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5129184600&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51967&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51967/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51967&quot;&gt;#51967&lt;/a&gt;), narrowed eager CUDA graph regions (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5092896769&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51430&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51430/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51430&quot;&gt;#51430&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5156348462&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52401&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52401/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52401&quot;&gt;#52401&lt;/a&gt;), and ROCm enablement on gfx11 and gfx950 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4766317415&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47017&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47017/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47017&quot;&gt;#47017&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5145545577&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52212&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52212/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52212&quot;&gt;#52212&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speculative decoding advances&lt;/strong&gt;: DFlash2 with local convolution and a candidate selector (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5185508751&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52816&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52816/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52816&quot;&gt;#52816&lt;/a&gt;), DSpark confidence-scheduled verification (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4824929811&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47808&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47808/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47808&quot;&gt;#47808&lt;/a&gt;), and async scheduling auto-enabled for draft models (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4862124280&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48341&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48341/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48341&quot;&gt;#48341&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Runner V2 maturation&lt;/strong&gt;: E/P/D disaggregation (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4155353913&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/38390&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/38390/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/38390&quot;&gt;#38390&lt;/a&gt;), weight offloading (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5091635999&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51413&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51413/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51413&quot;&gt;#51413&lt;/a&gt;), multi-layer MTP KV cache support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4993780584&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50062&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50062/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50062&quot;&gt;#50062&lt;/a&gt;), encoder CUDA graphs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4979046200&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/49852&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49852/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49852&quot;&gt;#49852&lt;/a&gt;), decoder token-wise poolin