&lt;li&gt;move the PD bootstrap registry under api_server::disaggregation: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33895&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33895/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33895&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
