&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unfetchable or unparseable multimodal inputs now return HTTP 400 instead of 500&lt;/strong&gt;, and text-only models reject media input outright: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31417&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31417/hovercard&quot;&gt;#31417&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32914&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32914/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32914&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
