&lt;p&gt;Landed this cycle but not yet usable end-to-end: &lt;strong&gt;MiniMax-M3&lt;/strong&gt; completes its four-part landing (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/28715&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/28715/hovercard&quot;&gt;#28715&lt;/a&gt;, begun in v0.5.14) but its &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.sglang.io/cookbook/autoregressive/MiniMax/MiniMax-M3&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;cookbook&lt;/a&gt; still points at a dev image (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31819&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31819/hovercard&quot;&gt;#31819&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inkling&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Inkling model support: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31681&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31681/hovercard&quot;&gt;#31681&lt;/a&gt; ⭐&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Inkling cookbook: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31360&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31360/hovercard&quot;&gt;#31360&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Docs] Inkling cookbook: mark B300/GB300 recipes verified, tune B300 MTP mem fractions: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31550&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31550/hovercard&quot;&gt;#31550&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
