&lt;li&gt;Spec V1 deprecated; EAGLE/MTP run on the unified V2 worker: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25464&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25464/hovercard&quot;&gt;#25464&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spec V2 extended to the FlashMLA backend: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24640&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24640/hovercard&quot;&gt;#24640&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptive speculative decoding: batch-size-aware &lt;code&gt;num_steps&lt;/code&gt; + observability metrics: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24055&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24055/hovercard&quot;&gt;#24055&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25940&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25940/hovercard&quot;&gt;#25940&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
