&lt;li&gt;Draft-extend CUDA Graph for the trtllm &lt;code&gt;mha&lt;/code&gt; attention backend: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25002&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25002/hovercard&quot;&gt;#25002&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
