&lt;li&gt;Qwen 3.5: FlashInfer GDN kernels on Blackwell: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22921&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22921/hovercard&quot;&gt;#22921&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23273&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23273/hovercard&quot;&gt;#23273&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
