&lt;h2&gt;Scheduler &amp;amp; Runtime&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overlap Scheduler: fewer CPU–GPU sync points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unified async value passing through FutureMap; prefill input transfer moved onto the forward stream, reducing per-step launch overhead and improving stability under high concurrency: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25945&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25945/hovercard&quot;&gt;#25945&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25879&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25879/hovercard&quot;&gt;#25879&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/26380&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/26380/hovercard&quot;&gt;#26380&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Runtime memory-safety checks enabled by default in CI to guard correctness continuously: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/27461&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/27461/hovercard&quot;&gt;#27461&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/26335&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/26335/hovercard&quot;&gt;#26335&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
