&lt;p&gt;v0.5.12.post1 is a stability patch on top of v0.5.12. It cherry-picks 12 fixes — primarily for DeepSeek V4 — onto the release branch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;DeepSeek V4&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4-Pro emits garbled text during single-token decode on B200/B300 (fix &lt;code&gt;deep_gemm&lt;/code&gt; UE8M0 scale-packing path by ceiling activation scales before packing): &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4473942693&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25733&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25733/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25733&quot;&gt;#25733&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4 + EAGLE/MTP in disaggregation decode crashes around 2000 requests with a SWA allocator assertion (recycled KV pages kept stale sliding-window mappings): &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4480739038&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25805&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25805/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25805&quot;&gt;#25805&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4 NSA prefill context-parallel (&lt;code&gt;--enable-nsa-prefill-context-parallel --nsa-prefill-cp-mode round-robin-split&lt;/code&gt;) in &lt;code&gt;--disaggregation-mode prefill&lt;/code&gt;: scheduler crash at startup: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4453649926&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25396&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25396/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25396&quot;&gt;#25396&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4 HiSparse + &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_OPT_USE_COMPRESSOR_V2=1&lt;/code&gt;: GSM8K accuracy restored from 0.825 → 0.960: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4468904214&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25646&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25646/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25646&quot;&gt;#25646&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4 PD disaggregation now works with pipeline parallelism &amp;gt; 1 (removed stale &lt;code&gt;pp_size=1&lt;/code&gt; assertion): &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4476624441&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25771&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25771/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25771&quot;&gt;#25771&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4-Flash with &lt;code&gt;--load-format dummy&lt;/code&gt; + FlashInfer mxfp4 hits CUDA illegal memory access during CUDA-graph capture (the integer &lt;code&gt;HashTopK.tid2eid&lt;/code&gt; lookup table was left uninitialized by dummy load): &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4485440625&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25892&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25892/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25892&quot;&gt;#25892&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4 HiCache + &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_OPT_CACHE_SWA_TRANSLATION=1&lt;/code&gt; returns stale translation indices after a cache rebuild, causing OOB writes / wrong outputs: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4485312264&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25889&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25889/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25889&quot;&gt;#25889&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Disaggregation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[PD][NIXL] Always send aux on &lt;code&gt;is_last&lt;/code&gt;; only expect state when truthy: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4473279824&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25699&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25699/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25699&quot;&gt;#25699&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix missing &lt;code&gt;group&lt;/code&gt; arg in &lt;code&gt;get_dp_buffer&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4467183998&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25585&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25585/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25585&quot;&gt;#25585&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Performance&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4: warm MHC token-count buckets at startup (gated to &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_OPT_DEEPGEMM_HC_PRENORM=1&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_OPT_USE_TILELANG_MHC_PRE=1&lt;/code&gt; + hybrid SWA) to eliminate 20–40s cold-bucket forward stalls: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4481250633&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25810&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25810/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25810&quot;&gt;#25810&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSV4-Pro: precompile a DeepGEMM branch for &lt;code&gt;_dispatch_bf16_fp32_backend&lt;/code&gt; to cut runtime JIT compile cost: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4484112840&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25860&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25860/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25860&quot;&gt;#25860&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Dependencies&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;[cu13]&lt;/code&gt; extra for &lt;code&gt;nvidia-cutlass-dsl&lt;/code&gt; (default to CUDA 13; required for sm_103 / B300): &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4466792416&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25576&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25576/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25576&quot;&gt;#25576&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
